 "headline": "Hunter Keeps MONSTARS Alive Over Thug Life",
 "notes": [
  "Thug Life just took steals from MONSTARS, and Karl-Anthony Towns has one point to show for the night. That is the entire contribution.",
  "White Mambas flipped both DREB and steals off Adam Silver Dez Nuts, and Bam Adebayo is sitting on 17 points and 11 rebounds.",
  "Tyrese Maxey has 30 points and LeBron James a 25-10-12 line, and Gopher Gold still only ranks first tonight because theInfamous is that useless.",
  "Kenrich Williams is 0-1 from the field for theInfamous. He has one job tonight, and it is not scoring.",
  "Shai Gilgeous-Alexander has 4 points on 2-5 shooting for Adam Silver Dez Nuts, and VJ Edgecombe's 18 is the only reason the night is survivable."
 ],
